.TH env_get 3
.SH NAME
env_get \- retrieve an environment variable value
.SH SYNTAX
.B #include <env.h>

.B const char* env_get(const char* \fIs\fP);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B env_get
searches the current process environment (\fIenviron\fP) for the 
environment variable named \fIs\fP.

.SH RETURN VALUE
A pointer to the value part of the environment variable, or NULL 
if no matching variable is found.